/**
 * Inline monochrome marks for the agents that can drive this app.
 *
 * Why inline and not `<img src="/agents/*.svg">`: those files carried the
 * brand colour in a `fill` attribute, so the row read as a set of coloured
 * stickers, and each one had to be sized and placed by hand. Here every
 * glyph is `fill="currentColor"`, so the colour comes from the theme and the
 * row reads as one family: flat, monocolour, no box, no border, no
 * background behind any of them.
 *
 * Sizing: the marks keep their own proportions, the way skills.sh does it.
 * All of them are 24 px tall; the width follows the drawing, so the wing
 * (a tall mark) is narrower than the square ones and the gaps stay even.
 *
 * Provenance and licence of each path: see `AGENT-LOGOS-NOTICE.md` next to
 * this file.
 */

